- **Doom II** ([apps/DoomApp.tsx](file:///home/user/prompt-recipes/demos/gemini_95/rounds/regen-r1/apps/DoomApp.tsx)): Playable Doom embedded in an iframe (defaulting to Internet Archive's MS-DOS player with quick mirror switchers).
- **Gemini Chat** ([apps/GeminiChat.tsx](file:///home/user/prompt-recipes/demos/gemini_95/rounds/regen-r1/apps/GeminiChat.tsx)): Retro chat window with streaming replies, blue user text, and green AI text.
