- **Gemini Client** ([services/geminiService.ts](file:///home/user/prompt-recipes/demos/gemini_95/rounds/regen-r1/services/geminiService.ts)): Lazily reads `process.env.API_KEY` only when AI features are invoked, with graceful offline fallbacks when the key is empty.

